WEBVTT

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:17.000
Your hand…

00:00:20.270 --> 00:00:22.900
Why did you stop me?  Why?

00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:26.540
Bommer, I can't forgive him either.

00:00:26.940 --> 00:00:31.880
But if you try to settle things by 
force, then you're no better than him.

00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:34.010
Yusei!

00:00:48.420 --> 00:00:52.490
Everyone in the stadium, please remain calm.

00:00:52.490 --> 00:00:58.250
As the director of the Public Maintenance 
Department, I have the responsibility to protect you.

00:00:58.250 --> 00:01:01.490
No matter what happens, I will protect you.

00:01:01.900 --> 00:01:03.460
Even if it means it's 
in exchange for my life.

00:01:07.480 --> 00:01:10.700
He calmed everyone down 
with his eloquent words.

00:01:10.700 --> 00:01:12.340
He's a cunning man.

00:01:13.890 --> 00:01:17.290
Under Security's authority, 
we're arresting you.

00:01:18.480 --> 00:01:21.990
Yusei, accomplish your own mission.

00:01:46.080 --> 00:01:51.370
No matter how far apart we 
are, we can't be stopped

00:01:51.460 --> 00:01:56.400
That's deeply engraved into us

00:01:56.540 --> 00:02:04.940
So don't be afraid of getting hurt

00:02:07.300 --> 00:02:10.880
Break through even further

00:02:11.260 --> 00:02:16.440
While carrying you beliefs in your heart

00:02:17.870 --> 00:02:23.570
There's always only one truth

00:02:23.710 --> 00:02:27.410
So feel the voice of your heart

00:02:28.640 --> 00:02:32.230
With your unwavering emotions

00:02:32.650 --> 00:02:38.260
Seize the signs of tomorrow

00:03:07.720 --> 00:03:13.590
Past Revealed
Duel Profiler vs Black Rose Witch

00:03:24.120 --> 00:03:26.480
You should get ready soon.

00:03:27.020 --> 00:03:29.250
It's finally time to do my job.

00:03:29.650 --> 00:03:35.260
I've collected 16 years worth of data 
on Aki Izayoi into these 40 cards.

00:03:35.260 --> 00:03:37.600
No wonder you're the profiler.

00:03:38.310 --> 00:03:41.370
I'll draw out what you desire.

00:03:41.900 --> 00:03:45.360
When that happens, I would like 
to receive five times my fee.

00:03:48.550 --> 00:03:50.220
Are you surprised?

00:03:50.220 --> 00:03:53.230
I lost this arm in an accident.

00:03:54.320 --> 00:03:56.950
Aki, are you scared?

00:03:58.200 --> 00:04:01.230
I'm going to hurt someone again.

00:04:03.860 --> 00:04:07.740
Don't be scared.  You're the 
future of psychic duelists.

00:04:07.740 --> 00:04:13.240
When you understand your pride and duty, 
you'll be able to part with this mask.

00:04:16.030 --> 00:04:21.380
Show them your beautiful face 
to let them know you exist.

00:04:22.970 --> 00:04:26.880
It's time for the second semifinal 
that you've all been waiting for!

00:04:26.880 --> 00:04:30.500
The dueling worker Kodo Kinomiya!

00:04:31.770 --> 00:04:35.360
Facing him is the person who made a 
lasting impact in the first round!

00:04:35.360 --> 00:04:38.050
The black rose witch Aki Izayoi!

00:04:38.050 --> 00:04:39.610
The witch is here.

00:04:39.610 --> 00:04:41.260
What's going to happen this time?

00:04:41.930 --> 00:04:44.190
The game is a standing duel!

00:04:44.190 --> 00:04:46.450
Isn't he scared?

00:04:46.450 --> 00:04:49.530
Of course he's scared.  
The opponent is a witch.

00:04:49.530 --> 00:04:51.500
It'll be bad if he makes her angry.

00:04:52.160 --> 00:04:55.060
I want to be friends with the witch.

00:04:55.060 --> 00:04:57.290
Her power is incredible.

00:05:02.080 --> 00:05:04.820
How's your D-Wheel?

00:05:04.820 --> 00:05:06.680
It's fine.

00:05:07.470 --> 00:05:10.610
What do you think of the witch?

00:05:11.590 --> 00:05:13.380
I'll find out in this duel.

00:05:14.410 --> 00:05:17.840
The anticipated battle begins now!

00:05:23.050 --> 00:05:24.460
Duel!

00:05:24.460 --> 00:05:26.590
My turn.  I draw.

00:05:26.960 --> 00:05:29.090
I summon Violet Witch.

00:05:30.680 --> 00:05:34.930
Next, I activate the Field Spell 
Black Garden from my hand.

00:05:38.660 --> 00:05:40.300
It's started.

00:05:40.300 --> 00:05:44.050
You just seal yourself 
away in your own world.

00:05:48.890 --> 00:05:50.830
I set one card.

00:05:51.280 --> 00:05:52.900
I end my turn.

00:05:52.900 --> 00:05:58.250
Izayoi has already used Black 
Garden!  What will Kinomiya do?

00:05:58.250 --> 00:06:00.530
My turn.  I draw!

00:06:00.910 --> 00:06:04.790
I know why you use Black Garden.

00:06:04.790 --> 00:06:08.080
You want to become friends with other people.

00:06:08.120 --> 00:06:11.890
However, this is how you behave 
towards family and friends.

00:06:12.310 --> 00:06:14.650
I set one card and end my turn.

00:06:15.080 --> 00:06:18.240
What?  All Kinomiya did was set a card!

00:06:18.240 --> 00:06:23.740
This set card symbolizes all 
the people you've met so far.

00:06:23.740 --> 00:06:27.360
No one wants to be friends with a witch.

00:06:27.860 --> 00:06:33.840
It's those eyes!  Everyone is afraid of 
those eyes that stare at the opponent!

00:06:35.230 --> 00:06:37.460
This is another way to duel.

00:06:38.340 --> 00:06:43.170
Kinomiya is a duelist known as a profiler.

00:06:43.600 --> 00:06:46.820
That's right.  Before the battle, he analyzes

00:06:46.820 --> 00:06:49.820
the opponent's profile in 
order to create his deck.

00:06:51.760 --> 00:06:53.970
My turn.  I draw.

00:06:54.600 --> 00:06:55.480
Battle.

00:06:55.850 --> 00:06:59.390
Violet Witch attacks you directly.

00:07:05.000 --> 00:07:10.130
Just as we expected, Izayoi's 
direct attack damaged Kinomiya!

00:07:10.820 --> 00:07:13.960
You hurt another person again in a duel.

00:07:14.600 --> 00:07:17.630
Psychic duelist Aki Izayoi!

00:07:19.890 --> 00:07:21.560
Psychic duelist?

00:07:22.120 --> 00:07:30.700
Three years ago on May 15, you hurt a 
classmate using Violet Witch during dueling practice.

00:07:36.340 --> 00:07:40.910
That was the first time you used 
your power at Duel Academy.

00:07:40.910 --> 00:07:46.120
From that point on, everyone was afraid 
of you, so you turned your back on them.

00:07:46.870 --> 00:07:49.840
Just like the back of this card!

00:07:51.310 --> 00:07:53.990
How does he know this?

00:07:54.390 --> 00:07:57.980
Your power is a sinful thing 
that you shouldn't have.

00:07:57.980 --> 00:08:00.980
Disgusting power requires punishment.

00:08:00.980 --> 00:08:03.990
I activate the trap card 
Crime and Punishment!

00:08:03.990 --> 00:08:08.350
This card activates when 
I take direct damage.

00:08:08.350 --> 00:08:11.350
One of your monsters is destroyed.

00:08:14.200 --> 00:08:16.400
Violet Witch's monster effect.

00:08:16.750 --> 00:08:21.000
When this card is sent from the 
field to the graveyard, I add one

00:08:21.000 --> 00:08:26.000
Plant-Type monster with 1500-or-fewer 
defense points from my deck to my hand.

00:08:26.000 --> 00:08:29.830
The card I select is Phoenixian 
Cluster Amaryllis.

00:08:29.830 --> 00:08:34.050
You once again selected a card that 
has deep meaning for a 16 year-old.

00:08:35.300 --> 00:08:37.460
Crime and Punishment's effect!

00:08:37.460 --> 00:08:43.220
At the end of the Battle Phase, I can Special 
Summon one Level 4-or-below monster from my hand!

00:08:43.220 --> 00:08:46.230
I Special Summon Agent of 
Hatred in defense position!

00:08:53.800 --> 00:08:59.040
Due to Black Garden's effect, the attack 
points of the summoned monster are halved.

00:08:59.040 --> 00:09:00.720
Too bad.

00:09:00.720 --> 00:09:04.010
Agent of Hatred has zero 
attack and defense points!

00:09:04.010 --> 00:09:06.270
The effect of that spell is meaningless!

00:09:06.830 --> 00:09:13.530
Since you Special Summoned Agent of Hatred, I 
can Special Summon one Rose Token on to my field.

00:09:14.490 --> 00:09:20.570
The Token that I Special Summoned using this 
effect cannot be destroyed in battle or attack.

00:09:20.810 --> 00:09:25.570
Then I also activate Agent 
of Hatred's monster effect!

00:09:27.170 --> 00:09:31.750
Once a turn during your Battle 
Phase, I can regain life

00:09:31.750 --> 00:09:35.750
points equal to the battle 
damage I took from one attack.

00:09:36.900 --> 00:09:39.930
His life points returned back to the start.

00:09:40.640 --> 00:09:42.690
He's cunning.

00:09:43.460 --> 00:09:44.680
What's wrong?

00:09:44.680 --> 00:09:46.630
Do you feel weird again?

00:09:46.630 --> 00:09:49.040
I feel itchy.

00:09:49.820 --> 00:09:53.640
From my hand, I summon Phoenixian 
Seed in defense position.

00:09:56.590 --> 00:09:58.880
Black Garden's effect activates.

00:10:00.320 --> 00:10:04.610
Black Garden halves the attack points 
of the summoned monster, and Rose

00:10:04.610 --> 00:10:08.610
Token is Special Summoned on to the 
opponent's field in attack position.

00:10:10.360 --> 00:10:13.470
I activate the Continuous Trap Rose Flame.

00:10:14.300 --> 00:10:17.260
When a Plant-Type monster 
is summoned on to the

00:10:17.260 --> 00:10:21.260
opponent's field, the opponent 
take 500 points of damage.

00:10:30.170 --> 00:10:34.000
This time, you're replaying what 
happened when you were 5 years old.

00:10:36.970 --> 00:10:40.190
It's the day you won a 
duel for the first time.

00:10:47.770 --> 00:10:54.630
The excitement of your first victory awakened the 
power that was laying dormant in your consciousness!

00:10:55.260 --> 00:10:58.930
My power just doesn't 
destroy things around me.

00:11:02.070 --> 00:11:03.970
It also destroys a person's soul.

00:11:04.340 --> 00:11:07.590
But this power keeps growing.

00:11:12.040 --> 00:11:13.230
I…

00:11:15.040 --> 00:11:16.800
I end my turn.

00:11:17.380 --> 00:11:20.460
You're a monster that's 
destroying this world.

00:11:20.460 --> 00:11:25.040
Since you're a monster, go back to your 
monster's nest!  This world is for humans!

00:11:50.160 --> 00:11:52.200
My turn.  I draw.

00:11:52.200 --> 00:11:55.770
From my hand, I activate the 
spell card Mind Monster.

00:11:58.160 --> 00:11:59.830
Mind Monster'S effect.

00:12:00.340 --> 00:12:03.080
I guess what monster you have.

00:12:03.480 --> 00:12:07.490
I guess Black Rose Dragon!

00:12:10.120 --> 00:12:18.660
If you have the monster I guessed, you take 
damage equal to half that monster's attack points.

00:12:18.660 --> 00:12:21.710
Black Rose Dragon has 2400 attack points.

00:12:22.030 --> 00:12:29.870
You take half its attack points as 
damage, so you take 1200 points!

00:12:31.100 --> 00:12:33.250
An attack finally worked on the witch!

00:12:33.250 --> 00:12:34.820
Sucker!

00:12:36.410 --> 00:12:41.970
Too bad.  If I had your power, 
I could have hurt you for real.

00:12:42.340 --> 00:12:45.370
Stay tuned for the next turn.

00:12:45.880 --> 00:12:50.180
I switch Rose Token on my field to 
defense position and end my turn.

00:12:50.180 --> 00:12:52.550
My turn.  I draw!

00:12:56.000 --> 00:13:00.340
Even if physical scars heal, 
scars of the heart never do.

00:13:05.570 --> 00:13:08.070
I change pain to power.

00:13:08.070 --> 00:13:11.160
Since I know pain, that's why I have power.

00:13:12.090 --> 00:13:14.270
The person who taught me that was…

00:13:14.750 --> 00:13:18.100
I'm Divine of the Arcadia Movement.

00:13:18.100 --> 00:13:21.500
I'm not at your level, but I 
have a power similar to yours.

00:13:24.580 --> 00:13:26.070
What's wrong?  Bring it!

00:13:26.070 --> 00:13:30.400
Arcadia Movement is depending on your power!

00:13:33.270 --> 00:13:37.370
He finally mentioned the 
name Arcadia Movement.

00:13:37.370 --> 00:13:39.840
The utopia for psychic duelists.

00:13:40.290 --> 00:13:45.020
A fiendish group who meet and act in secret.

00:13:47.550 --> 00:13:51.640
I came here because I believe in someone.

00:13:52.070 --> 00:13:54.590
And I have the power I need!

00:13:54.590 --> 00:13:57.330
Phoenixian Seed's monster effect.

00:13:58.210 --> 00:14:02.220
By sending this faceup card on 
my field to the graveyard, I

00:14:02.220 --> 00:14:07.220
can Special Summon Phoenixian 
Cluster Amaryllis from my hand!

00:14:12.490 --> 00:14:16.280
Due to the effect of Black Garden, 
the summoned monster's attack

00:14:16.280 --> 00:14:21.280
points are halved, and Rose Token is 
summoned on to the opponent's field.

00:14:21.740 --> 00:14:27.190
Since Rose Token was Special Summoned, 
the Continuous Trap Rose Flame activates!

00:14:28.970 --> 00:14:29.980
Battle!

00:14:29.980 --> 00:14:34.550
Phoenixian Cluster Amaryllis 
attacks Rose Token!

00:14:41.670 --> 00:14:45.770
When Phoenixian Cluster Amaryllis 
attacks, it is destroyed.

00:14:46.140 --> 00:14:48.130
Then its monster effect activates.

00:14:48.130 --> 00:14:54.410
When this card is destroyed and sent to the 
graveyard, it deals 800 points of damage.

00:14:56.030 --> 00:14:59.140
So that's why it self-destructed 
after the attack.

00:15:02.860 --> 00:15:05.940
Due to Agent of Hatred's monster effect,

00:15:05.940 --> 00:15:07.940
Kinomiya regains life points 
equal to the battle damage!

00:15:07.940 --> 00:15:10.010
My body is tearing apart…

00:15:12.830 --> 00:15:16.210
The witch is seriously trying to end my life.

00:15:16.680 --> 00:15:19.710
If my life points become zero, there 
are more important things than my fee.

00:15:20.030 --> 00:15:23.380
It's not worth my life!

00:15:23.760 --> 00:15:27.020
I set one card and end my turn.

00:15:27.450 --> 00:15:31.130
During the End Phase of my 
turn, I can Special Summon

00:15:31.130 --> 00:15:35.130
Phoenixian Cluster Amaryllis from 
my graveyard in defense position.

00:15:35.430 --> 00:15:39.650
This means Rose Token is Special 
Summoned on to Kinomiya's field!

00:15:39.660 --> 00:15:42.790
The Continuous Trap Rose Flame activates.

00:15:43.430 --> 00:15:46.800
The Continuous Trap's 
attack assails Kinomiya!

00:15:49.540 --> 00:15:52.010
You freak…

00:15:52.010 --> 00:15:54.110
My turn!  I draw!

00:15:54.110 --> 00:16:00.410
I release three Rose Tokens to Special 
Summon Mad Profiler from my hand!

00:16:01.960 --> 00:16:09.160
I can Special Summon Mad Profiler from my 
hand by releasing three monsters on my field!

00:16:09.450 --> 00:16:13.640
Due to the effect of Black 
Garden, the monster's attack

00:16:13.640 --> 00:16:17.640
points are halved, and Rose Token 
is summoned on to Izayoi's field!

00:16:18.920 --> 00:16:20.830
This isn't a job anymore.

00:16:20.830 --> 00:16:24.100
I don't want money.  I'll win quickly 
so that I can leave this place!

00:16:24.550 --> 00:16:27.130
Mad Profiler's monster effect.

00:16:27.130 --> 00:16:31.260
By sending one card to the 
graveyard, a card on the field

00:16:31.260 --> 00:16:35.260
that's the same type as the discarded 
card is removed from play!

00:16:39.460 --> 00:16:41.990
He sent a spell card to the graveyard.

00:16:41.990 --> 00:16:45.530
Now the attack points won't be halved.

00:16:46.800 --> 00:16:49.890
I'm going to continue using 
Mad Profiler's monster effect.

00:16:50.310 --> 00:16:52.300
I send a monster card to the graveyard.

00:16:52.700 --> 00:16:56.270
Phoenixian Cluster Amaryllis 
is removed from play!

00:16:57.360 --> 00:17:00.700
Now when a monster is destroyed, 
the monster effect won't activate!

00:17:00.700 --> 00:17:01.580
Let's battle!

00:17:02.490 --> 00:17:06.210
Mad Profiler, attack Rose Token!

00:17:11.340 --> 00:17:14.320
Nice!  Keep attacking that freak!

00:17:14.660 --> 00:17:18.090
I hope you learned that a freak 
shouldn't disgrace the art of dueling!

00:17:18.360 --> 00:17:19.870
Go back to your nest!

00:17:20.220 --> 00:17:22.450
This is a very good turn of events.

00:17:22.450 --> 00:17:28.620
By sensing danger from Kinomiya, 
Izayoi's power as a Signer will awaken.

00:17:28.990 --> 00:17:32.950
I activate the Equip Spell 
Destruction Insurance from my hand.

00:17:36.330 --> 00:17:39.040
That Equip Spell is troublesome.

00:17:39.040 --> 00:17:44.940
When the equipped monster is destroyed, the 
opponent takes damage equal to half its attack points.

00:17:45.870 --> 00:17:49.660
Mad Profiler has 2600 attack 
points.  If she takes half

00:17:49.660 --> 00:17:53.660
for 1300 points of damage, her 
life points will become zero.

00:17:54.240 --> 00:17:58.340
Then I activate another Equip 
Spell!  Lightlow Protection!

00:18:00.280 --> 00:18:02.400
He's being extremely careful.

00:18:02.780 --> 00:18:06.700
With that Equip Spell, if the 
opponent's monster effect changes

00:18:06.700 --> 00:18:10.700
the attack points of the equipped 
monster, that card is destroyed.

00:18:11.100 --> 00:18:14.790
This is definitely in order to 
counter that monster effect.

00:18:17.400 --> 00:18:19.440
Black Rose Dragon.

00:18:19.840 --> 00:18:21.920
My turn.  I draw.

00:18:21.920 --> 00:18:24.040
I summon Twilight Rose Knight.

00:18:26.890 --> 00:18:33.640
Level 3 Tuner Monster Twilight Rose 
Knight tunes two Level 2 Rose TokenS.

00:18:34.380 --> 00:18:37.810
The cold flame envelops the entire world.

00:18:38.210 --> 00:18:40.790
Black flower, bloom!

00:18:42.520 --> 00:18:44.030
Synchro Summon!

00:18:45.150 --> 00:18:48.370
Appear, Black Rose Dragon!

00:18:50.600 --> 00:18:51.740
There it is!

00:18:56.320 --> 00:18:58.040
The witch's ace in the hole.

00:18:58.390 --> 00:19:01.130
Bring it!  I'll counter it!

00:19:01.130 --> 00:19:03.970
You're a freak whose parents abandoned you!

00:19:09.610 --> 00:19:14.870
I won't forgive someone like you 
who stomps on a person's heart.

00:19:15.300 --> 00:19:18.110
I'll carve pain into your body!

00:19:19.200 --> 00:19:22.660
I use information to protect myself.

00:19:23.830 --> 00:19:29.490
With this many Equip Spells and Agent 
of Hatred, there's no way I can lose!

00:19:29.890 --> 00:19:34.010
I'll reflect her psychic 
powers back with my cards!

00:19:38.320 --> 00:19:41.400
Black Rose Dragon's monster effect.

00:19:41.400 --> 00:19:44.580
By removing one Plant-Type 
monster in my graveyard

00:19:44.580 --> 00:19:48.580
from play, your monster's 
attack points become zero.

00:19:48.580 --> 00:19:50.700
Rose Restriction!

00:19:54.370 --> 00:19:56.350
I was waiting for that!

00:19:56.350 --> 00:19:59.090
I activate Lightlow Protection's effect!

00:19:59.110 --> 00:20:02.780
When the equipped monster's 
attack points change

00:20:02.780 --> 00:20:05.780
due to your monster effect, 
that card is destroyed!

00:20:15.030 --> 00:20:16.360
Signer…

00:20:19.410 --> 00:20:24.010
It's coming!  I'm feeling it!

00:20:24.780 --> 00:20:27.840
He has fulfilled his job.

00:20:29.730 --> 00:20:33.240
I activate the trap card Rose Curse.

00:20:35.790 --> 00:20:41.570
When the attack points of a monster on your 
field changes, you take damage equal to

00:20:41.570 --> 00:20:47.570
the difference between that monster's 
original attack points and its new attack points.

00:20:49.270 --> 00:20:50.280
Do it.

00:21:04.550 --> 00:21:08.590
It's over!  Hurry up and 
bring the paramedics!

00:21:10.300 --> 00:21:14.920
Aki Izayoi advances to the finals!

00:21:21.540 --> 00:21:24.650
That's good, Aki.  Well done.

00:21:25.130 --> 00:21:29.200
However, your powers will be 
truly tested in the finals.

00:21:29.830 --> 00:21:33.640
In the duel against Yusei Fudo.  Be ready.

00:21:37.280 --> 00:21:39.670
What did you learn from her cards?

00:21:40.390 --> 00:21:42.700
Rejection and anger.

00:21:43.520 --> 00:21:47.650
However, she's still hiding something.

00:22:04.590 --> 00:22:10.170
What can we grasp?  What can we do?

00:22:10.530 --> 00:22:15.560
We'll step forward and find out

00:22:15.930 --> 00:22:21.480
My unstoppable emotions, the 
beating of my passionate heart

00:22:21.640 --> 00:22:26.720
I heard the voice of truth

00:22:26.910 --> 00:22:29.880
After I was hurt, I learned

00:22:32.450 --> 00:22:35.470
Of a place where I can become stronger

00:22:37.420 --> 00:22:42.630
I stack my dreams in my palm

00:22:42.760 --> 00:22:48.030
And I'll someday pass them to you

00:22:48.460 --> 00:22:53.970
Seeking for the signal 
to start, my soul roars

00:22:54.270 --> 00:22:59.310
I will overcome my suffocating 
and mediocre life

00:22:59.840 --> 00:23:05.370
I'll dash and acquire all the bright futures

00:23:05.510 --> 00:23:14.780
Carrying the bonds I believe 
in, I run towards tomorrow
